<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.93.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.93.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.3 trillion yen of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.93   Stop rate     0.277 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.932  Average yield 0.266 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	 5.29161  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted bids    1.29976  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 17.2546 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 Dec 20, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity	   Mar 21, 1997</p>
</text>
